category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel libexpat-devel
sdesc: "Ultra lightweight xml-rpc lib for C++ (utilities)"
ldesc: "ulxmlrpcpp is a library to call methods on a remote server. It's main goal is
to be as easy to use as possible but be fully compliant. It is object oriented
and written in C++."
skip:

homepage: https://sourceforge.net/projects/ulxmlrpcpp/
